# Monorepo Refactoring & Architecture Restructuring Plan

Restructure `Leaf-Check-AI` from a confusing root directory layout (mixing empty classic MVC `model/` and `controller/` folders with Expo app files and IoT hardware code) into a clean, technology-domain-isolated monorepo. We are abandoning the MVC pattern in favor of a modern **Component + Service/Hook architecture** tailored for Expo Router (v54) and IoT hardware integration.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **MVC Pattern Deprecation**: The empty `model/`, `controller/`, `view/`, and `src/` folders at the root directory will be deleted entirely.
> - **Supabase Relocation**: `supabase/supabase.ts` will be migrated into `services/supabase.ts` to consolidate all backend and API logic under `services/`.
> - **Hardware Boundary**: All PlatformIO and embedded C++ hardware code is strictly isolated inside `hardware/firmware/`.

